            "Entries": 
            {
            "cc_canyon1/GameStateQuery WEATHER Town Rain Storm GreenRain/Time 1800 2400": "nightTime/4 6/farmer 4 9 0 Sandy 3 5 1 Wizard 4 5 3/skippable/addConversationTopic canyon1 5/pause 800/speak Wizard \"The dancers have begun their ballet.\"/pause 300/faceDirection Sandy 2/faceDirection Wizard 2/emote Sandy 16/pause 400/move farmer 0 -2 0/speak Sandy \"@! What are you doing here so late?#$b#The bus to the valley already left...$s\"/pause 200/speak Wizard \"Your timing is unfortunate, @.\"/emote Sandy 16/faceDirection Sandy 1/pause 100/faceDirection Sandy 2/pause 200/speak Sandy \"Oh, you already know each other?#$b#I should have guessed you'd make friends with the mysterious!$h\"/pause 400/speak Wizard \"'The mysterious,' hmm...#$b#Whatever task you came for, I advise you hurry home.#$b#The desert will not be safe tonight.\"/pause 400/speak Sandy \"Yeah... it's gonna get wild.$s\"/pause 400/speak Wizard \"Tell me @, how much do you know about deserts?\"/playMusic LavaMine/speak Wizard \"Some believe it never rains in the desert, but there's a hidden truth.$2#$b#There is a long dry season, followed by a destructive wet season.#$b#Once a year, a storm rages through the gorges and canyonlands beyond this oasis.#$b#It is a storm of all storms!$1#$b#A MONSOON!$1\"/pause 1200/stopMusic LavaMine/pause 300/speak Sandy \"Yep, and once a year, our friend here stops by with a cute little note about keeping the shop dry.\"/pause 400/emote Wizard 40/pause 400/speak Wizard \"It is a complex barrier spell against water elementals.\"/pause 200/ speak Sandy \"Anyway, the bigger issue here is rainpuffs!$s#$b#Right before the monsoon hits, there's this special bush that flowers up and releases puffballs.$1\"/pause 200/speak Wizard \"Creosote... one of the most potent and long-lived medicinal plants.\"/pause 400/speak Sandy \"Yeah, and they make great tea!$h#$b#It's a total waste, but the storm is going to wash them all away at this rate.$s\"/pause 400/faceDirection Wizard 3/pause 200/speak Wizard \"I discern your desire to rush out and collect what you can.#$b#It is ill-advised - only one experienced in the elemental arts should venture out now.\"/pause 200/faceDirection Sandy 1/pause 200/faceDirection Sandy 2/emote Sandy 40/pause 400/question fork1 \"#Offer to help Sandy#Ask the Wizard to warp you home\"/fork GoHome/pause 200/speak Sandy \"Oh wow, really?$h#$b#I didn't realize you were an elemental artist!$h#$b#Even just one rainpuff would be great.\"/pause 100/faceDirection Wizard 3/pause 200/faceDirection Wizard 2/pause 200/speak Wizard \"Hmm.#$b#I suppose...#$b#I will hold off the worst of the torrent for a few hours.\"/pause 200/faceDirection Sandy 1/pause 400/speak Wizard \"But be warned... when true night falls, nothing in this world can stop the flood.\"/pause 200/showFrame Wizard 16/pause 200/playSound shwip/shake Wizard 5/faceDirection Wizard 3 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 0 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 1 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 2 true/pause 50/showFrame Wizard 16/pause 500/playSound wand/pause 200/shake Wizard 300/pause 600/speak Wizard \"I've cleared the way forward to the canyonlands.#$b#Follow the sidewalk along the road outside... away from the valley.$2\"/pause 400/playSound shwip/faceDirection Wizard 3 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 0 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 1 true/pause 50/faceDirection Wizard 2 true/pause 50/showFrame Wizard 16/pause 500/playSound wand/pause 400/warp Wizard -3000 -3000/specificTemporarySprite wizardWarp/screenFlash 1/pause 400/faceDirection Sandy 2/pause 200/speak Sandy \"Be safe, @, I'll be waiting up for you.$h\"/pause 200/end", 
"GoHome": "pause 300/speak Wizard \"Of course.\"/pause 300/speak Sandy \"It was nice to see you, @!#$b#Maybe next year you'll get a chance to try my rainpuff tea!\"/pause 200/playSound wand/pause 400/end newDay/"			}
           
