            "cc_canyon1_5/i CC_Rainpuff":"nightTime/4 6/Sandy 3 5 2 farmer 4 8 0/skippable/addConversationTopic creosoteking 5/pause 200/emote Sandy 16/pause 200/move Sandy 1 0 1/move Sandy 0 1 2/pause 200/speak Sandy \"I'm so glad you're okay!\"/playMusic rain/pause 600/faceDirection Sandy 0/pause 1200/speak Sandy \"Wow...$3\"/pause 1200/stopMusic rain/pause 400/faceDirection Sandy 2/pause 600/speak Sandy \"Just like that, the 'magical barrier' must be up again#$b#So...$s#$b#How did it go out there?\"/pause 600/faceDirection farmer 2/pause 400/itemAboveHead CC_Rainpuff/emote Sandy 16/pause 1400/faceDirection farmer 0/removeItem CC_Rainpuff 1/emote Sandy 56/pause 400/speak Sandy \"You're a lifesaver, @.$h#$b#These rainpuffs can be distilled into the most amazing tea.#$b#The boss in back really likes them.#$b#I'm sure he won't mind if I share the recipe with you!$h\"/pause 300/addCookingRecipe CC_Remedytea/message \"You learned how to brew Remedy Tea!\"/pause 500/speak Sandy \"Whew... everything turned out okay.#$b#Oh! And here's one more thing for you, since it's getting late...\"/pause 200/itemAboveHead 688/pause 1600/addItem 688 1 0/pause 1600/speak Sandy \"You know... I bet a farmer like you could figure out how to grow creosote bushes.#$b#It would be cool if they were growing on a local farm... wink wink.$h#$b#Okay, @, get home safe!\"/pause 200/end" }
